    - Top row: 5 amber stars (`<Star className="fill-amber-400 text-amber-400 w-5 h-5" />` — universal kept row, NEVER shifts to cyan).
    - Quote: DM Sans `text-base md:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed italic`. ~30-word lorem ipsum.
    - Attribution row (DM Sans weight 600, smaller, `text-slate-900` for name, `text-slate-500` for meta):
      - Review 1: `Sample Reviewer 1 — Sample Town — Sample Service — Sample Date`
      - Review 2: `Sample Reviewer 2 — Sample Town — Sample Service — Sample Date`
      - Review 3: `Sample Reviewer 3 — Sample Town — Sample Service — Sample Date`

