## About

- **Tone:** DARK + spotlight radial gradient.
- **Composition:** **Copy LEFT, image RIGHT** (mirror of Template 3's image-left). `lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0` full-bleed split — copy `<div>` is the first child (left half), image `<div>` is the second child (right half).
- **Owner portrait status:** PERMANENT_ABSENCE. No owner photo anywhere.
- **Copy-half (left):**
  - Background: `bg-[#0F1E3D]` + spotlight radial-gradient overlay (`bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center_left,rgba(26,46,92,0.6)_0%,rgba(10,20,41,0.95)_100%)]` — gradient centered toward the copy column so the spotlight brightens the text area) + `noise-overlay` (Phase 3).
  - Padding: `p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16`.
  - Content:
    - Accent bar `h-1 w-12 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full mb-4`.
    - Eyebrow `text-cyan-400 text-xs md:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide font-semibold`.
    - H2: `About Heading Placeholder` (literal policy placeholder). DM Serif Display weight 400, `text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl tracking-tight`. **Inherits white from parent** — NO explicit color class.
    - Body: 2 paragraphs lorem ipsum (~3 sentences each), DM Sans weight 400 `text-slate-200 leading-relaxed`.
    - Attributed quote block: `border-l-4 border-l-cyan-400 pl-6 my-8`. Italicized 1–2 sentence lorem ipsum quote in `text-slate-100 text-lg`.
    - Attribution: `— [Owner Name], Owner` (policy placeholder), `text-slate-300 text-sm not-italic`.
- **Image-half (right):**
  - Full-bleed Unsplash photo of **landscaping/hardscape equipment at twilight / branded service truck at blue hour / completed installation lit by accent lights / raw materials stockpile (stone, gravel) in a lit workspace**. PERSON-FREE / ANIMAL-FREE / LIVING-THING-FREE. HEAD-checks 200. `<ImageWithFallback fill object-cover />`.
  - Overlay: `bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent via-[#0F1E3D]/30 to-[#0F1E3D]/80` (darker edge on the left where image meets copy half, blending edge-to-edge with the spotlight overlay on the copy half).
  - `noise-overlay` div on top (Phase 3).
- **Voice:** First-person plural ("we"/"our crew") in body paragraphs. Singular "I" only in the attributed quote.

## Recent Work

- **Tone:** DARK-DEEPEST flat + star-field decorative overlay. This is the **centerpiece spectacle** of the template.
- **Background (FOUR-layer composition, bottom to top):**
  1. **Layer 1 — flat deepest midnight:** `bg-[#0A1429]` (no spotlight gradient here — Recent Work intentionally reads as the darkest, most atmospheric section of the page).
  2. **Layer 2 — star-field decorative overlay (atmospheric depth, NOT literal stars):** `bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_30%_20%,rgba(255,255,255,0.05),transparent_40%),radial-gradient(circle_at_70%_60%,rgba(34,211,238,0.04),transparent_40%)] pointer-events-none absolute inset-0` — soft white + cyan glows from two off-center points evoke a night-sky depth without being literally stars.
  3. **Layer 3 — `noise-overlay`** (Phase 3, CRITICAL — largest dark flat area on the page).
  4. **Layer 4 — content container** with `relative z-10`.
- **Vertical padding:** `py-20 md:py-24 lg:py-28` (generous breathing room — the carousel is meant to feel theatrical).
- **Header cluster (centered, max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 md:mb-16):**
  - Accent bar `h-1 w-12 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full mb-4 mx-auto`.
  - Eyebrow `text-cyan-400`.
  - H2: DM Serif Display weight 400 `text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight inline-block pb-2 border-b-2 border-b-cyan-400`. Inherits white. The cyan underline IS one of the 13 cyan touchpoints.
  - 1-sentence lead `text-slate-300 mt-4`.
- **Carousel architecture: VERBATIM from `sliding-strip-carousel-prompt.md`.** No deviation in the underlying mechanics — sliding-strip + virtualIndex + skipAnim + clone-and-snap wrap-around loop architecture is identical to Templates 1, 2, 3. Library: `framer-motion`. NO autoplay. `useReducedMotion()` honored. `motion.div drag="x" dragMomentum={false} dragElastic={0.2}`. CSS `touch-action: pan-y`. Cursor `cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing select-none`. **Every `<Image>` has `draggable={false}`.**
- **Template-4 visual treatments LAYERED on top of the verbatim carousel (do NOT modify the underlying architecture):**
  - **(a) Per-slide dark vignette overlay:** Inside every slide's wrapper, ABOVE the Image but BELOW any caption: `<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,transparent_40%,rgba(0,0,0,0.6)_100%)] pointer-events-none rounded-xl">`. Edges of every slide darken into the surrounding midnight — gives the carousel its cinematic frame.
  - **(b) Active slide cyan glow + ring (peeks have NEITHER):** Active slot adds `ring-2 ring-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(34,211,238,0.4)]`. Peek slots have no ring and no glow. The ring/glow transitions smoothly when slides change — animate via framer-motion with the same `(prefersReducedMotion || skipAnim) ? { duration: 0 } : { duration: 0.4, ease: 'easeOut' }` guard pattern the carousel uses for caption transitions. **CRITICAL:** the `skipAnim` guard prevents the glow from flicker-snapping at the wrap-around seam (the most likely Template-4-specific regression — verify in Phase 4).
  - **(c) Project titles in DM Serif Display at larger size than other templates:** Below each slide, `text-2xl md:text-3xl text-slate-200 mt-4 text-center`. Lorem ipsum 3–5 words per policy. The larger size makes the title a focal element rather than a footnote.
- **Active slot scale `1`, opacity `1`. Peek slots `scale: 0.92`, `opacity: 0.4`.** (Standard prompt values.)
- **Slides (6 total):** Each an Unsplash image of completed landscape work, **biased toward twilight/dusk/blue-hour where natural**:
  - Slide 1: Finished paver patio with fire pit at twilight (no surrounding seating/people).
  - Slide 2: Dry-stack stone retaining wall with accent lighting.
  - Slide 3: Formal walkway with bordering hedges, lit at blue hour.
  - Slide 4: Pergola/gazebo as architectural feature under spotlight.
  - Slide 5: Water feature (fountain or reflecting pool) at dusk.
  - Slide 6: Driveway hardscape install at blue hour with landscape lighting.
  - Each subject confirmed PERSON-FREE / ANIMAL-FREE / LIVING-THING-FREE. HEAD-checks 200 (verified by `scripts/verify-images.mjs` in Phase 2). Rendered via `ImageWithFallback`.
- **Prev/Next arrows + dot indicators below.** Standard prompt pattern. Dots use cyan for active state (`bg-cyan-400`), `bg-white/30` for inactive.

## FAQ

- **Tone:** LIGHT.
- **Background:** `bg-white`.
- **Vertical padding:** `py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-24`.
- **Header cluster (max-w-3xl mb-12):**
  - Accent bar `h-1 w-12 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full mb-4`.
  - Eyebrow `text-cyan-600`.
  - H2 DM Serif Display `text-3xl md:text-4xl text-slate-900`.
  - 1-sentence lead `text-slate-600`.
- **Layout:** Two-column desktop (`lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8`), single-column mobile.
- **Items (7 total):**
  - Q1: `FAQ 1`; Q2: `FAQ 2`; …; Q7: `FAQ 7` (literal policy placeholders).
  - Answer: 2–3 sentences of lorem ipsum each, DM Sans weight 400 `text-slate-600 leading-relaxed`.
- **Accordion state:** `useState<number | null>(null)` — **ALL closed by default**. NEVER `useState(0)`.
- **Item styling — glass-card with cyan-tinted open glow:**
  - Closed: `bg-white rounded-xl p-6 ring-1 ring-slate-200/60 shadow-[0_8px_24px_-12px_rgba(15,23,42,0.2)] transition-all duration-300`.
  - Open: `bg-white rounded-xl p-6 ring-1 ring-cyan-500/40 shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(34,211,238,0.1)]` — the cyan-tinted glow is the visual highlight of the open item.
  - Question row: DM Serif Display weight 400 `text-xl text-slate-900` + chevron icon (`text-slate-600`, rotates on open).
  - Answer reveal: framer-motion `<motion.div initial={{ height: 0 }} animate={{ height: 'auto' }}>` with `overflow: hidden`.

## CTA Section

- **Tone:** DARK + spotlight radial gradient.
- **Background:** `bg-[#0F1E3D]` + spotlight radial-gradient overlay (`bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(26,46,92,0.6)_0%,rgba(10,20,41,0.95)_100%)]`) + `noise-overlay` (Phase 3 — CRITICAL).
- **Vertical padding:** `py-20 md:py-24 lg:py-28`.
- **Layout:** `lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start`. Copy LEFT, ContactForm RIGHT. Mobile stacks copy first, form below.
- **Copy column:**
  - Accent bar `h-1 w-12 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full mb-4`.
  - Eyebrow `text-cyan-400 text-xs md:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide font-semibold`.
  - H2: DM Serif Display weight 400 `text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight`. Inherits white. Generic lorem ipsum company-voice line ("Ready to / Let's / Get a..." framing).
  - Subhead: DM Sans `text-slate-200 text-lg`. 1–2 sentences.
  - **Bullet checklist (3–4 items):** Each row `flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-100`. Lucide `Check` icon `w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400` + lorem ipsum benefit text.
  - **Phone block (emerald — universal kept row):** `bg-emerald-700 text-white p-4 rounded-lg`. Phone icon + click-to-call `<a href="tel:+15551234567">(555) 123-4567</a>` + "Call now" label. **NEVER shifts to cyan or any palette.**
  - **Big cyan-glow CTA button (highest contrast on the page):** `inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-cyan-400 text-slate-900 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-cyan-300 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,0.4)] hover:shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(34,211,238,0.6)] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-400/40 transition-all duration-300`. Label: lorem ipsum action phrase ("Get a Free Quote" or generic equivalent).
- **Form column:** Same `components/ContactForm.tsx` from Hero. Form anchor id is NOT `#quote` here (that's reserved for Hero); use `id="cta-form"` or leave anchorless. Glass-card styling adapts to dark bg: `backdrop-blur-xl bg-slate-900/40 ring-1 ring-white/20 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-6 md:p-8` — same glassmorphism as the Hero form card.

## Footer

- **Tone:** DARK-DEEPEST flat.
- **Background:** `bg-[#0A1429]` + `noise-overlay` (Phase 3 — CRITICAL — largest dark flat area beside Recent Work).
- **Top edge:** `border-t border-t-cyan-400/30` — thin cyan hairline that visually separates Footer from CTA Section. Mitigates the dark→dark adjacency.
- **Vertical padding:** `pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-20 md:pb-12 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-12`.
- **Main wrapper requirement (in `app/layout.tsx`):** `<main className="pb-20 md:pb-0">{children}</main>` — gives Mobile Sticky CTA Bar (h-20 on mobile) the clearance it needs above the footer.
- **Grid:** 4-column desktop (`lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8`), single-column mobile.
  - **Column 1 — Brand:**
    - Text-only `[Template 4]` (NO Lucide icon). DM Serif Display weight 400 `text-2xl text-white`.
    - 1-line lorem ipsum description in `text-slate-400`.
  - **Column 2 — Services:**
    - Heading: explicit `text-white font-semibold mb-4` — "Services". (Explicit color because the base CSS rule sets font-family only.)
    - List of 8 service titles (`Service 1` through `Service 8`) as `text-slate-400 hover:text-cyan-400` links (`href="#"` or `href="#services"`).
  - **Column 3 — Service Area:**
    - Heading: explicit `text-white font-semibold mb-4` — "Service Area".
    - List of 5× `Sample Town` placeholders (5 distinct labels: `Sample Town One`, `Sample Town Two`, `Sample Town Three`, `Sample Town Four`, `Sample Town Five` — or all literal `Sample Town`, developer choice during Phase 2).
  - **Column 4 — Contact:**
    - Heading: explicit `text-white font-semibold mb-4` — "Contact".
    - Phone: `<a href="tel:+15551234567" className="hover:text-cyan-400">(555) 123-4567</a>`.
    - Email: `contact@placeholder.com` placeholder.
    - Address: `123 Sample Street, Sample Town, ST 00000` placeholder.
- **Bottom bar (`mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 text-slate-500 text-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4`):**
  - Left: `© {new Date().getFullYear()} [Template 4]. All rights reserved.`
  - Right: Small links row — Privacy · Terms · Sitemap (all `href="#"`, `hover:text-cyan-400`).

